# Ignored deliberately. `cdk synth` writes the results of environment lookups here — including the
# AWS account ID — and the walkthrough in README.md tells operators to run it, so the file appears
# in a working tree as a consequence of following the docs. CDK's own guidance is that committing it
# makes synth reproducible across machines; that trade is right for a repo that deploys one
# environment, and wrong for a public reference implementation that deploys none. Ignore it.
cdk.context.json
